  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancement of Integrated Disaster Response Capacity through the Implementation and Operation of the ENSURE (GreEN and Smart Urban REsilience) Center in Vietnam</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">By establishing Smart Integrated Disaster Management Center and efficient urban disaster response system, reducing damages related to disasters in Vietnam, securing the safety of citizens and tourists, and improving the quality of civil life.1. &#xc7ac;&#xb09c; &#xd1b5;&#xd569;&#xbaa8;&#xb2c8;&#xd130;&#xb9c1;&#xacfc; &#xc2e0;&#xc18d;&#xd55c; &#xc7ac;&#xb09c;&#xc804;&#xd30c;&#xb85c; &#xc778;&#xba85; &#xbc0f; &#xc7ac;&#xc0b0;&#xd53c;&#xd574; &#xc800;&#xac10;
2. &#xc704;&#xd5d8;&#xc5d0; &#xcc98;&#xd55c; &#xc2dc;&#xbbfc;&#xc758; &#xae34;&#xae09;&#xc2e0;&#xace0;&#xc5d0; &#xb300;&#xd55c; &#xc2e0;&#xc18d; &#xad6c;&#xc870;</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consulting service to enhance the urgan disaster response process and strategyl Enhancing governance capacity and institution for urban disaster mangement; Capacity building for human resources regarding the Information system and disaster management poilicy; building integrated management system for emergency report; building integrated urban disaster management system; building an open data platform for urban disaster; building a spatial(2d,3d) open data platform; establishing ENSURE centre</narrative>
  </description>
